       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             TPMHELPM.
       AUTHOR.                 W. ROXBURY.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *REMARKS.                ON-LINE HELP DISPLAY SCREENS FOR THE
      *                        MMIS PM SCHEDULE MAINTENANCE PROGRAM
      *                         ****.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN       TO WORKSTATION-ZPMHELPS-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS  IS SCREEN-STATUS
                               MAJOR-MINOR
                  CONTROL-AREA IS SCREEN-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC         PIC X(2000).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  PASSWORD-INFORMATION.
           05  NAME-OF-PROGRAM     PIC X(08) VALUE "TPMHELPM".
           05  PROGRAM-TYPE        PIC X(02) VALUE "IN".
           05  PROGRAM-RELEASE     PIC X(12) VALUE " J0100010001".
           05  PROGRAM-DESCRIPTION.
               10  PROG-DESC-A1    PIC X(30) VALUE
                  "HELP DISPLAY SCREENS FOR THE M".
               10  PROG-DESC-A2    PIC X(30) VALUE
                  "MIS PM SCHEDULE               ".
               10  PROG-DESC-B1    PIC X(60) VALUE
                  "MAINTENANCE PROGRAM.".
               10  PROG-FUNCTION1  PIC X(60) VALUE
                   "DO NOT APPLY A PASSWORD".
           05  PASSWORD-FLAG       PIC X.

       01  SCREEN-DATA.
           05  CC-CODE         PIC ZZZ9.
           05  SCREEN-MSGS.
               10  CMDMSG      PIC X(79).
               10  ERRMSG      PIC X(79).

           COPY SCREENIO       IN COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  HELP-DATA.
           05  HELP-SW         PIC 9999.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION      USING HELP-DATA.
       BEGIN.
           OPEN I-O            DISPLAY-FILE.
           MOVE SPACES         TO SCREEN-DATA.

           IF HELP-SW = 1
               MOVE "VHELP1"   TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 2
               MOVE "VHELP2"   TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 21
               MOVE "VHELP21"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 211
               MOVE "VHELP211" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 22
               MOVE "VHELP22"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 23
               MOVE "VHELP23"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 24
               MOVE "VHELP24"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 25
               MOVE "VHELP25"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 3
               MOVE "VHELP3"   TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 31
               MOVE "VHELP31"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 314
               MOVE "VHELP314" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 315
               MOVE "VHELP315" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 316
               MOVE "VHELP316" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 321
               MOVE "VHELP321" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 322
               MOVE "VHELP322" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 323
               MOVE "VHELP323" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 324
               MOVE "VHELP324" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 33
               MOVE "VHELP33"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 331
               MOVE "VHELP331" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 332
               MOVE "VHELP332" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 336
               MOVE "VHELP336" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 34
               MOVE "VHELP34"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 4
               MOVE "VHELP4"   TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 406
               MOVE "VHELP406" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 41
               MOVE "VHELP41"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 42
               MOVE "VHELP42"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 43
               MOVE "VHELP43"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 45
               MOVE "VHELP45"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 451
               MOVE "VHELP451" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 46
               MOVE "VHELP46"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 461
               MOVE "VHELP461" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 47
               MOVE "VHELP47"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 5
               MOVE "VHELP5"   TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 54
               MOVE "VHELP54"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 541
               MOVE "VHELP541"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 55
               MOVE "VHELP55"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 6
               MOVE "VHELP6"   TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 62
               MOVE "VHELP62"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 66
               MOVE "VHELP66"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 661
               MOVE "VHELP661"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 67
               MOVE "VHELP67"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 68
               MOVE "VHELP68"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 681
               MOVE "VHELP681" TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 69
               MOVE "VHELP69"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 7
               MOVE "VHELP7"   TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 72
               MOVE "VHELP72"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 74
               MOVE "VHELP74"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 8
               MOVE "VHELP8"   TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           IF HELP-SW = 999
               MOVE "VHELPXX"  TO SCREEN-NAME
               GO TO SHOWFORM.
           MOVE HELP-SW        TO CC-CODE
           MOVE "VHELP00"      TO SCREEN-NAME.

       SHOWFORM.
           MOVE "00"           TO SCREEN-STATUS.
           MOVE SCREEN-DATA    TO DISPLAY-REC.

           WRITE DISPLAY-REC   FORMAT IS SCREEN-NAME
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS.
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN WRITE ERROR.  SCREEN-STATUS IS "
                        SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE  FORMAT IS SCREEN-NAME
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN READ ERROR.  SCREEN-STATUS IS "
                        SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.
           MOVE ALL B"0"       TO SCREEN-INDICATORS.

           IF KEY-HIT = 12
               CALL "SPMHDI"
               GO TO SHOWFORM.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE               DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.
